<%
  /*
   * Navigation without a full page load — the URL changes and the page does
   * not flash.
   *
   * Loaded last and entirely optional: with it blocked, or failing, every link
   * on the site is still an ordinary link and every form still posts normally.
   * It is an enhancement on a working site, never a dependency of one.
   */
%>
<%
  /*
   * The progress bar loads FIRST, and separately, because it is the one that
   * matters on the pages the router never touches — the sign-in form posting,
   * the hand-off to Google. nav.js uses it if it is there and works without it
   * if it is not.
   */
%>
<script src="/js/loadbar.js?v=<%= config.version %>"></script>
<script src="/js/nav.js?v=<%= config.version %>"></script>
<%
  /*
   * The eye at the end of a password box. Loaded for every page rather than
   * for the two that have a password field today, because the third one — the
   * confirmation step — was added this week and would have been forgotten.
   * It decorates nothing on a page with no password field and costs a cached
   * request.
   */
%>
<script src="/js/reveal.js?v=<%= config.version %>"></script>
</body>
</html>
